flowchart TD
  HIST["Source-native natal claims: Western, Jyotish, Chinese, Tibetan, Maya, HD"]
  MAYA["20 colonial Yucatec days, Highland Momostenango + Zunil kept separate"]
  NONNATAL["Maya codex astronomy / electional or modern Dreamspell"]
  SOURCE["Individual historical source + chart policy and uncertainty"]
  MAPPING["Source-specific claim -> common behavioral domain; record overlaps"]
  BANK["Existing Survey V2 / Life Patterns V1.9 / V3 research candidate; one common item bank"]
  GAP{"Is the observable covered directly and source-faithfully?"}
  HOLD["Source-only or proxy; not automatically scored"]
  OPTIONAL["At most one neutral, opted-in physical-making clarification if source evidence is missing; chart-blind"]
  FREEZE["Future joint study: freeze model/claims, questions, response handling, decoys, nulls BEFORE scored answers"]
  ANSWERS["One shared blind response set per consenting new participant"]
  MULTI["Score each eligible tradition separately; correct multiple testing and shared dependencies"]
  END["Compare to matched decoys + nonastrology, retain negatives and uncertainty"]
  SEPARATE["Separate event/ritual study; not a natal personality question"]
  HIST --> SOURCE
  MAYA --> SOURCE
  NONNATAL --> SEPARATE
  SOURCE --> MAPPING
  BANK --> GAP
  MAPPING --> GAP
  GAP -- "No direct measure" --> HOLD
  GAP -- "Conditional opt-in candidate, still unfrozen" --> OPTIONAL
  GAP -- "Covered" --> FREEZE
  OPTIONAL --> FREEZE
  FREEZE --> ANSWERS --> MULTI --> END
